# Overdue groups entries by due date, oldest first, document order within a date.
file <<END
- Recent @due({today-1})
- Oldest @due({today-9})
- Middle A @due({today-4})
- Middle B @due({today-4})
END
keys gO
see 9 days ago ·
see 4 days ago ·
see ▌ - Oldest
keys j
see ▌ - Middle A
keys j
see ▌ - Middle B
keys j
see ▌ - Recent
keys x
quit
saved <<END
- Recent @due({today-1}) @done({today})
- Oldest @due({today-9})
- Middle A @due({today-4})
- Middle B @due({today-4})
END
